   "i": 1,
   "en": "Fuel exports increased",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/DiktatFuelBonusScript.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "Proven stable source (due to outcome of Diktat conflict)",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/DiktatFuelBonusScript.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "    - Colonies receive %s accessibility",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/EstablishedPolityScript.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "Established Polity gained",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/EstablishedPolityScript.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "Actions that postpone a crisis often have unintended consequences and cause their own problems in the long run. Ultimately, crises can not be avoided, and must instead be dealt with and exploited for the opportunities they provide.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/HABlowbackFactor$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "Points remaining: %s",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/HABlowbackFactor$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "Will contribute %s of the points per month to event progress, and will also increase the value that progress is reset to after a crisis.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/events/HABlowbackFactor$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "Blowback",
